    {
      "type": "text", "id": "t09", "x": 600, "y": 345, "width": 560, "height": 150,
      "text": "#0  事实验证先于假设 → 读代码/搜文档\n#1  从 existing context 出发 → 不凭空画\n#2  drawlib 组件库复用 → 能复用绝不手绘\n#3  Junior Designer → 先 show 骨架再迭代\n#4  给 variations → 不给「最终答案」\n#5  Placeholder > 烂实现 → 诚实留白\n#6  System 优先 → 每个元素 earn its place\n#7  反手绘 slop → ≤4色 · roughness≤1 · 对齐网格",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 402, "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000, "link": null, "locked": false
    },

