    {
      "type": "text", "id": "t10", "x": 60, "y": 560, "width": 260, "height": 30,
      "text": "references/\n知识库 · 13 个文件", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 501, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "r08"
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "t11", "x": 40, "y": 600, "width": 300, "height": 175,
      "text": "workflow.md          开工流程/问答\nelement-format.md    元素格式/调色板\ndrawlib-catalog.md   组件库清单\nprototype-workflow   原型工作流\narchitecture-workflow 架构工作流\nlayout-system.md     网格/对齐/泳道\ncolor-system.md      配色纪律\nanti-slop.md         反手绘 slop 清单\nanimation-pipeline   动画帧模型\nanimation-best-prac  节奏/easing\naudio-design-rules   BGM/SFX 规则\nverification.md      验证清单\ncritique-guide.md    评审/打分",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#495057", "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 502, "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000, "link": null, "locked": false
    },

