    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "t13", "x": 420, "y": 600, "width": 320, "height": 175,
      "text": "basic-ux-wireframing  UX 控件 (69)\nwebpage-frames        网页框 (3)\nforms                 表单控件 (26)\ninformation-arch      信息架构 (17)\ndev_ops               DevOps 图标 (29)\ndata-viz             图表占位 (32)\nstick-figures         火柴人 (9)\n\n→ 复用协议: 能复用绝不手绘\n→ 取用: 按名称/序号从 .excalidrawlib 取 elements",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#495057", "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 602, "version": 1,
